Package: infrakit-studio
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: InfraKit Studio <noreply@example.com>
Description: Local-first SRE, SysAdmin & Developer Workbench
 InfraKit Studio bundles tuning calculators, dev utilities, FormFlow,
 office/media tools, and cheatsheets into one offline-first Flutter app.
 Run with --serve to headlessly serve the web UI over HTTP instead of
 opening the native GUI window.
